    "title": "San Antonio Podcaster Paul Anthony Ramos uplifts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago When my former Palo Alto College student, Paul Anthony Ramos, asked me to be on his podcast, Generation Latino, I was delighted to accept. During my 22 years at Palo Alto College, I taught thousands of students, but Paul is one who stands out. I truly don’t think I’ve ever met someone with such a bright aura. Even as a 19-year-old young adult, Paul’s warmth, can-do spirit and sparkle was evident. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
